1790108441301407	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyshA		item.comment	bn-3ncfp	{"body":"IDL 1.12->1.13 (rule artifact_class.spelling, rules 44->45), protocol stays 3.6. Canonical spelling = class token (ws). Rust: daemon::provisioning typed refusal; Builder::try_build; register_capability -> Result. gate_g2_02 F3 pin flipped to the_artifact_class_spelling_is_a_typed_refusal_at_provisioning; F2 now 2 probes. RFC 0026 corr 49 + flag F22; RFC 0027 corr 32. just check: all green except lead-owned PLAN_BONE_TRACEABILITY staleness; just lean green."}	blake3:VzRQrjB3L33vSv9LmX2CwuEh5yVORl8U2I9gAEH-1eg
