1790109486850080	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyuhA		item.comment	bn-ah1k8	{"body":"Two commits in ws bn-ah1k8. (1) 44cdc2d: five IDL rules declare the domains of the six pinned String leaves (benchmark.task_identity, benchmark.graders, evidence.claim_identity, query.reuse_reasons, query.invalidation_edges); fields keep type String, RFC 0026 F23 records retypes as owed; RFC 0030 F2 + RFC 0034 cite the rules; gate_g1_02 exact-set pin now empty, plus DECLARED_DOMAINS check that each rule exists and cites its site, with a negative control. (2) final commit: IDL 1.14, IDL_VERSION, rules 45->50 in idl_conformance + gate_g2_01, RFC 0026 correction 50; protocol stays 3.6. next_operations tripwire untouched. just check: all cargo tests/clippy/fmt pass; only failure is dossier PLAN_BONE_TRACEABILITY staleness (lead-owned)."}	blake3:NzC-EEFR-N8oWej8SMUzQBbktSf4CPsPMiymzeo4ykk
