1790110039661438	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyvRA		item.comment	bn-28kv4	{"body":"Workspace commits 7e00232 (feat) + 253ff9c (version-only: IDL 1.15, protocol 3.7, rules 46). CapabilityDescriptor.instances: list<ArtifactHandle> optional + rule capability.instance_scope; per-class T2, typed ProvisioningRefusal::Instance, delegation narrowing, query/subscribe answers bounded, task_ scope does not cover cont_ (RFC 0027 corr 33). G1-07 census flipped to 18/19 (cap_ excluded by design); 6 new admission tests. just check: fmt, clippy, boundaries, covenant, governance, lean pass; dossier fails only on lead-owned traceability staleness; test fails ONLY gate_g2_06 leg2 which pins PROTOCOL_VERSION==3.6 as the user-ratified Phase A freeze (bn-762i). 3.7 needs a user decision before merge."}	blake3:D7DsICBOpmpHpnpwQf5zf6B0lZP1Nr0MFzBq67U4sfo
1790110070859367	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyvhA		item.comment	bn-28kv4	{"body":"Lead: HELD, not merged. Built at 7e00232 + 253ff9c (version-only). The protocol 3.7 bump crosses the user-ratified Phase A freeze at 3.6 (bn-762i, PHASE_A_EXIT_PACKAGE §4.4). Awaiting user ruling. On merge: renumber F23 / correction 50, because bn-ah1k8 took both at IDL 1.14."}	blake3:Dz_O_LJeHK3n7SNNlt0iTNDs94EJkAxtildXpXsrIDo
