1790110483082404	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEywBA		item.comment	bn-28kv4	{"body":"User ruling 2026-09-22: HOLD for Phase B, keep the 3.6 freeze. The implementation is parked in maw workspace bn-28kv4 (7e00232 feature + 253ff9c version-only; maw keeps it). On Phase B opening, rebase, renumber F23 / correction 50 (taken by bn-ah1k8), and bump from the then-current IDL. Also decide then on the subscription-revocation side effect (a revoked capability gets no further deltas, per R1)."}	blake3:sniJ4XISeeHHI0efSL112COPD_P9eiX-pKQ-31Bxgp4
1790110836057960	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEywRA		item.comment	bn-20142	{"body":"Resume branch of O2 built in ws bn-20142 (HEAD 11a2049). New daemon/continuation.rs: ContinuationRecord, an internal record of existing class cont_ (no schema bound to cont, no wire change, cont_ handle preimage unchanged so CLI goldens hold). It carries the pin preimage (startup re-derives the handle via Blake3), revision, park state, intent, bounds, operation, target, portfolio, priority, EpochSet, model, ceilings, spend, checkpoints, publications, milestones. Written before the campaign record at a park (campaign record index = commit point), and as the next revision before task.update_budget and task.cancel change a parked task (abort = PublicationAborted, no change). resolve_tasks reads task_ + cont_; bounded head + matching record -> Resolution::Restored(Suspended|Cancelled), restored as a live TaskEntry + Continuation (frontier read back through the model at resume); no record -> Failed(ContinuationNotDurable); two at top revision -> Failed(AmbiguousContinuation); unclaimed cont records reported. task.status answers a restored task with its pre-crash TaskRecord. Still missing: a durable terminal record for a closed task (Settled stays CapabilityDenied on task.status); events and CheckReport declared volatile. Tests: matrix crash sweep 18 runs now resume to byte-identical cold record, new 27-run proof-lane (update_budget) sweep; G1-04 pin flipped to regression_a_continuation_survives_a_restart_with_its_pins; G1-05 cancel fingerprint now names the one cancel record; G1-06 census + new all-or-nothing test for the cont seam; G1-08 debt list/verdict rewritten, new resume/admission/cancel tests. just check: all green except dossier PLAN_BONE_TRACEABILITY.md staleness (bone counts, lead-owned); just lean green."}	blake3:t-4yWl7FGhWP87O0zyaBQIcfYNcAq1JxtI6LVGMsVeU
